---
source: crates/mydiff-tui/src/folder.rs
expression: "body.join(\"\\n\")"
---
" ~ a_changed.txt                                        │ Navigate                        "
"   b_same.txt                                           │ j/k     down / up               "
" - c_only_left.txt                                      │ PgDn/Up page down / up          "
" + d_only_right/                                        │ g/G     top / bottom            "
" ~ e_bin                                                │ ]c/[c   next / prev change      "
" ~ f_ws.txt                                             │                                 "
"                                                        │ Compare                         "
"                                                        │ w       whitespace        exact "
"                                                        │ i       ignore case         off "
"                                                        │ b       ignore blank lines  off "
"                                                        │ e       ignore line endings  on "
"                                                        │                                 "
"                                                        │ Folder                          "
"                                                        │ Enter   open file diff          "
"                                                        │ s       identical files   shown "
"                                                        │                                 "
"                                                        │ General                         "
"                                                        │ F1      toggle this sidebar     "
"                                                        │ :       command line            "
"                                                        │ q/Esc   quit or go back         "
"                                                        │ Ctrl-c  quit from anywhere      "
"                                                        │                                 "
" [s]ame:s… ~3 -1 +1 =1  enter:open F1:keys :help q:quit │                                 "
